  "description": "The opening sequence of bench preparation that turns received sheets or an old volume into clean ordered sections ready to sew: gather and fold, collate, guard weak leaves and plates, and where the book is being rebound, pull it to pieces, refold, and knock out old joints.",
  "emitter": "opg://commons-seed",
